This directory contains a small, MODIFIED subset of rea-video
(https://github.com/JuneYaooo/rea-video), vendored into the ByteSize
News pipeline (newsletter_video/styles/). See README.md in this
directory for exactly which functions were adapted and how they differ.
The upstream project depends on OpenCV; the adapted functions here were
rewritten against numpy only. All modifications are released under the
same Apache License, Version 2.0.
